    "hwp 문서는 두 가지 뷰어로 열어 비교할 수 있습니다. 네이티브 뷰어는 오픈소스 hwp-swift(github.com/sboh1214/hwp-swift, LGPL-2.1 라이선스)를 사용하며, 별도로 폰트를 번들하지 않고 기기에 설치된 시스템 폰트로 렌더링합니다." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "hwp-Dokumente können zum Vergleich in zwei Viewern geöffnet werden. Der native Viewer verwendet die Open-Source-Software hwp-swift (github.com/sboh1214/hwp-swift, LGPL-2.1-Lizenz) und stellt den Text mit den auf dem Gerät installierten Systemschriften dar, ohne eigene Schriften mitzuliefern."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "hwp documents can be opened in two viewers for comparison. The native viewer uses the open-source hwp-swift (github.com/sboh1214/hwp-swift, LGPL-2.1 License) and renders with the system fonts installed on the device rather than bundled fonts."
          }
        },
        "en-CA" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "hwp documents can be opened in two viewers for comparison. The native viewer uses the open-source hwp-swift (github.com/sboh1214/hwp-swift, LGPL-2.1 License) and renders with the system fonts installed on the device rather than bundled fonts."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Los documentos hwp se pueden abrir en dos visores para compararlos. El visor nativo usa el software de código abierto hwp-swift (github.com/sboh1214/hwp-swift, licencia LGPL-2.1) y muestra el texto con las fuentes del sistema instaladas en el dispositivo, sin incluir fuentes propias."
          }
        },
        "es-MX" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Los documentos hwp se pueden abrir en dos visores para compararlos. El visor nativo usa el software de código abierto hwp-swift (github.com/sboh1214/hwp-swift, licencia LGPL-2.1) y muestra el texto con las fuentes del sistema instaladas en el dispositivo, sin incluir fuentes propias."
          }
        },
        "fil" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Mabubuksan ang mga dokumentong hwp sa dalawang viewer para maikumpara. Ginagamit ng native viewer ang open-source na hwp-swift (github.com/sboh1214/hwp-swift, LGPL-2.1 License) at nagre-render gamit ang mga system font na naka-install sa device sa halip na mga kasamang font."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
