    "라이선스: CC BY-ND(저작자표시-변경금지). 저작권 정보를 표시하면 상업적 이용을 포함해 사용할 수 있으나, 서체 자체를 변경하거나 2차적 저작물을 만들 수 없고, 폰트 파일 자체를 유료로 재판매할 수 없습니다." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Lizenz: CC BY-ND (Namensnennung – Keine Bearbeitungen). Die Nutzung ist auch kommerziell erlaubt, wenn die Urheberrechtsangaben angezeigt werden; die Schrift darf jedoch nicht verändert, nicht bearbeitet und die Schriftdateien nicht weiterverkauft werden."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "License: CC BY-ND (Attribution–NoDerivatives). It may be used, including commercially, if the copyright information is displayed, but the typeface itself may not be modified, derivative works may not be created, and the font files may not be resold."
          }
        },
        "en-CA" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Licence: CC BY-ND (Attribution–NoDerivatives). It may be used, including commercially, if the copyright information is displayed, but the typeface itself may not be modified, derivative works may not be created, and the font files may not be resold."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
